                    "value": "A finding is sharp for a pair when its prevalence in the two diseases differs by at least the cutoff. Each dot is a pair: the share of its 10 clinical findings that are sharp (across) against the share of its 22 biopsy findings (up). Top-left = biopsy-dependent.",
